# Docker build context for serving/Dockerfile and serving/Dockerfile.lean.
#
# ALLOWLIST. Everything is excluded, then exactly what the two Dockerfiles COPY
# is re-included. A new COPY source must be added here too;
# tests/test_docker_context.py fails if a COPY source would be excluded, and
# fails if anything outside this list (reports, paper, checkpoints, the local
# runtime/ tree, node_modules) would be sent.
#
# Not needed in the context: the 18 MB checkpoint (the build stage downloads it
# from the GitHub Release and checks its SHA-256), the frozen reports (read from
# the git tag, never at build time), the web app (built by Vercel).

*

# Build stage: research code, serving code and the frozen inference data.
!serving/
!src/
!data/mechanism_v1/

# Inputs of the DDI-Net 3.0 evidence artifact (serving/evidence/build.py).
!data/raw/drugbank.tab.gz
!web/public/data/drugs.json

# Never send caches or local build output, even inside allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.DS_Store
